OL,3,GNEWSAFundraiser embarks on 'most
OL,4,Amagical challenge' yet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fundraiser who has raised more than
OL,7,F#440,000 for charity is preparing to
OL,8,Frun 50 miles with 50 schools over two
OL,9,Fdays.
OL,11,FManny Singh Kang said his Manny's Mile
OL,12,Fwould be his "most magical" challenge
OL,13,Fbecause it would give young people the
OL,14,Fopportunity to try something new.
OL,16,FHe will visit 25 schools in
OL,17,FWolverhampton on Thursday 17 September
OL,18,Fand another 25 the following day with
OL,19,Fchildren and staff encouraged to join
OL,20,Fin, cheer him on and help spread
OL,21,Fawareness of dementia.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
