OL,3,GNEWSAFundraiser embarks on 'most
OL,4,Amagical challenge' yet
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's going to bring out heroes," he
OL,7,Fsaid. "Young children who may have
OL,8,Fnever done anything like this, may have
OL,9,Fnever run, may have never thought about
OL,10,Ffundraising."
